<div class="sectionB"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="span-3"><nav id="00370482-1b86-4f30-8ab8-4032e7f839ef" aria-label="Left menu" class="sub-tree tree-nav"><ul><li class="expanded"><a href="https://www.dma.dk/safety-at-sea" data-id="eaea14ff-25d8-421a-9794-957fb9701daa" lang="en"><span role="heading">Safety at sea</span></a><ul><li class="expanded"><a href="https://www.dma.dk/safety-at-sea/navigational-information" data-id="5b2ea5cf-4c27-4e9e-83a6-5ef0f9f2a549" lang="en"><span>Navigational information</span></a><button data-aria-label-unfold="Fold underpunkter ud" data-aria-label-fold="Luk undermenupunkter" class="toggler" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded aria-label="Luk undermenupunkter" type="button"></button><ul><li class="collapsed"><a href="https://www.dma.dk/safety-at-sea/navigational-information/nautical-information" data-id="d382dc61-2033-40fb-96ee-854238204ccc" lang="en"><span>Nautical information</span></a><button data-aria-label-unfold="Fold underpunkter ud" data-aria-label-fold="Luk undermenupunkter" class="toggler" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Fold underpunkter ud" type="button"></button></li><li class="active expanded"><a aria-current href="https://www.dma.dk/safety-at-sea/navigational-information/ais-data" data-id="ab5a0b27-535f-4db1-a435-2b7f31e6f8e4" lang="en"><span>AIS data</span></a><button data-aria-label-unfold="Fold underpunkter ud" data-aria-label-fold="Luk undermenupunkter" class="toggler" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded aria-label="Luk undermenupunkter" type="button"></button><ul><li class=""><a href="https://www.dma.dk/safety-at-sea/navigational-information/ais-data/passage-lines" data-id="787943b3-4965-4693-bc6d-d5bd33ea6e80" class="direct-child" lang="en"><span>Passage lines</span></a></li><li class=""><a href="https://www.dma.dk/safety-at-sea/navigational-information/ais-data/ais-data-management-policy" data-id="9f95317c-34bb-4131-88ad-9896c185681a" class="direct-child" lang="en"><span>AIS